{"tabData": ["1-50", "51-58"], "bookInfo": {"bookId": "41000116285", "bookName": "Un trato con el capitán de hockey", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000116970/41000116970.jpg@w=360&h=640", "viewCount": 25766248, "followCount": 655145, "introduction": "Dora, una chica ñoña de la universidad, se une al equipo de hockey como asistente, enamorada en secreto de Leo. Tras un rechazo humillante, hace un trato con el capitán del equipo, Troya, para que la ayude a conquistar el corazón de Leo. Mientras Dora se transforma y gana confianza, la chispa entre ella y Troya comienza a encenderse. Pero los secretos, sabotajes y sentimientos cambiantes complican todo.", "chapterCount": 58, "labels": ["Jock", "Modern"], "tags": ["Jock", "Modern"], "typeTwoIds": [294], "typeTwoNames": ["Romántica"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 294, "name": "Romántica", "replaceName": "romántica"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Romántica", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "A-Deal-With-The-Hockey-Captain", "bookNameLower": "a-deal-with-the-hockey-captain", "shelfTime": "2025-06-11 10:11:38", "firstShelfTime": "2025-06-11 10:11:38", "performerList": [{"performerId": "12279", "performerName": "Jake Galluccio", "performerFormatName": "Jake-Galluccio", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x7/12279/12279.jpg?time=1782186753061", "videoCount": 2}, {"performerId": "12046", "performerName": "Lydia Pentz", "performerFormatName": "Lydia-Pentz", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/6x4/12046/12046.jpg?time=1789637733002", "videoCount": 3}], "performerIdList": [12046, 12279]}, "recommends": [{"bookId": "42000033701", "bookName": "Fingiendo ser novios con mi peor enemigo", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000033701/42000033701.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 26166, "introduction": "Tras pillar a su novio engañándola, Ivana, una omega sin loba, acaba 